"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[22469],{22469:function(t){t.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/d63ec3d981978ec39c8ece986de3c561.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"스팟\\"\\n  address=\\"1 Cathedral Pl, East Melbourne VIC 3002 오스트레일리아\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"spot\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\n멜버른 <mark>East Melbourne</mark>에 위치한 대형 고딕 양식 성당이다.  \\n`1858년`에 착공해 `1939년`에 완공된, 건축에만 80년 이상이 걸린 건물이다.  \\n세 개의 첨탑이 멜버른 스카이라인을 압도하고, 내부의 <mark>스테인드글라스</mark>와 아치형 천장이 인상적이다.  \\n도심 한가운데 있는 곳이라고 생각하기 어려울 만큼 고요하고 차분한 분위기였다.  \\n종교와 무관하게 방문할 만한 관광 명소이고, 무료로 입장할 수 있다.  \\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/d63ec3d981978ec39c8ece986de3c561.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/a277dd1d2471bfdc5b193cf71597da27.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/7a411bf25b339bdc7c205f2632a5a12f.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/7f0a76953547d8bff960c3b64cff2be4.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/eac63d8f77b2d41c6d27704c70657097.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/339a3983f1de8bb078071ab3922625d2.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Saint Patrick\'s Cathedral\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);